Local data frames are not deployed to shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>, so you need to ensure that your application loads the data it requires from something that is bundled with the code that is deployed.

https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/229848967-Why-does-my-app-work-locally-but-not-on-shinyapps-io-

On Saturday, September 30, 2017 at 9:53:57 AM UTC-4, Jason Lewis wrote:
