> Calls: local ... tryCatch -> tryCatchList -> tryCatchOne -> <Anonymous>
> Execution halted
>
>
> "draft.picks" is a locally stored data frame, which is used to create a reactive data frame that is used throughout the app. However, it is also used from the local data frame as well (to populate "select" objects on some filters that I didn't want to be affected by other reactive filters that might be in use). Does anybody have any idea how to troubleshoot this? Thanks.

