Dear User group,
I am trying to deploy a shiny app for the first time and I get this error message:

Preparing to deploy application...Error: HTTP 404
GET https://api.shinyapps.io/v1/applications/223072
Not Found
Execution halted

In the dashboard I get this message
Account is suspended until {{ suspended_until | date:'medium' }} due to "{{ currentAccount['suspended_reason'] | lowercase }}".
All of your applications will be unavailable until then, or you can upgrade <https://www.shinyapps.io/admin/#/account/billing> your account.

What am I doing wrong? My shiny app works fine from RStudio on my computer.
Best regards,
Viki.

