MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The 404 error is likely because you had deleted the application, and then attempted to deploy it again.
If you delete an application, you need to clear out rsconnect/shinyapps.io/ <http://shinyapps.io/><accountname>/<applicationname>.dcf which stores the application id.

The unsubstituted text issue is a known UI issue when you deep link into the dashboard.

