It looks like that package was removed from CRAN <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ReadImages/index.html> in 2013 because it was orphaned. I suggest you find replacement package and update your code to a supported package.

Other then that, you could try installing the package using:

devtools::install_version('ReadImages', "0.1.3.3")

This might let let shinyapps detect the package, but its a long shot at this point.

-Andy

